  "partnerRating": "NotApplicable",
  "description": "<p>Want to pursue business education at one of the top business schools in Europe?</p><p>Are you looking to excel in business and management studies?</p><p>EU Business School offers English-taught business education programs. These include bachelor's, master's, MBA and doctorate degrees in Business Administration and other foundation programs.</p><p>The fields of study are Communication &amp; Public Relations, Leisure &amp; Tourism Management, Sports Management, International Relations, Design &amp; Innovation, Digital Business, Business Finance or Blockchain.</p><p>EU Business School also offers a selection of its programs through dedicated online programs.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><p>EU Business School was established in 1973 and has campuses in Geneva, Barcelona, and Munich.</p><p>The university offers state-accredited degrees by partnering with Universidad Católica San Antonio de Murcia (UCAM), the University of Derby, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/institutions/london-metropolitan-university/\">London Metropolitan University</a>, and Dublin Business School.</p><p>EU Business School’s Online MBA program has ranked first worldwide in the CEO Magazine Global MBA Rankings for ten years.</p><p>Want to know more? Discover why EU Business School might be the place for you!</p><p><strong>Why EU Business School?</strong></p><ul><li>EU Business School offers a strong foundation in business and management principles, and various business programs taught in English.</li><li>EU’s faculty comprises experienced professionals and offers students a thorough learning experience.</li><li>The university has strong connections with industry leaders and professionals, providing networking opportunities to students.</li></ul><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p><p>The university has students from over 100 nationalities. This contributes to global exposure and cultural diversity among the students.</p><p>The school actively promotes business practices, and leadership skills and helps students take advantage of this business education.</p><p>The university has strong industry connections with several companies to provide students with career workshops, networking events, and internship opportunities.</p>",
