      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>EU Business School was established in 1973 and has campuses in Geneva, Barcelona, and Munich.</p><p>The university offers state-accredited degrees by partnering with Universidad Católica San Antonio de Murcia (UCAM), the University of Derby, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/institutions/london-metropolitan-university/\">London Metropolitan University</a> and Dublin Business School.</p><p>EU Business School’s Online MBA program has ranked first worldwide in the CEO Magazine Global MBA Rankings for ten years.</p>",
