      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>The university has students from over 100 nationalities. This contributes to global exposure and cultural diversity among the students.</p><p>The school actively promotes business practices, and leadership skills and helps students take advantage of this business education.</p><p>The university has strong industry connections with several companies to provide students with career workshops, networking events, and internship opportunities.</p>",
